{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-03_beg","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-03","title":"並肩之約-1","storyCode":"7-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"bb6b712b788b2d07636f60f4af43efb15c67b61891e5506f4052ea4553879f95","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島艦橋 6:00 a.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位優秀的幹員們，現在開始，我會向羅德島全艦通報一些重要的資訊。這裡是阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島本艦已經在昨天晚上正式駛離了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們和龍門簽訂的長期貿易協定因為種種原因，已經失效。現在我們已經沒理由繼續在這座城市停留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一方面，羅德島在龍門購置了足夠的資源，這應該能讓我們多支撐一些時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另一方面......我們中的一些幹員，將會在不久後深入切爾諾伯格核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一場更加艱巨的戰鬥正在那裡等著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......很多人可能會覺得，戰爭離我們很遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭，好像是種國家與國家之間的對抗，與一家製藥企業沒什麼關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但戰爭......戰爭，我想戰爭從沒離開過我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們早就身在一場戰爭中了。那是一場對感染者極度不公，會讓所有人都相互仇恨的漫長戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了讓抗礦石病藥物成功研發，讓感染者有機會使用這種藥物，醫療幹員們在理論與實驗中都投入了大量的精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盡可能地讓礦石病患者在羅德島接受先進的抑制性治療，同時減緩礦石病的擴散和發展，也一直是我們的行動目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可這遠遠不夠。在這之前，感染者和普通人之間的矛盾正在不斷加劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敵視感染者的人不希望感染者得到救治，他們犯下的每一樁針對感染者的惡行，都增加了感染者與普通人間的不信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而另外一些人，利用感染者，奴役感染者，感染者只是他們的利益犧牲品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人僅僅因為我們在研發治療礦石病的藥物，就與我們敵對，甚至攻擊我們......這樣的事情，我們遭遇過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果我們研發出了藥物，卻再也沒有機會將這種藥物交付給感染者使用，那又會是什麼樣的光景？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的敵人遠不僅僅是“礦石病”。我們也已經沒辦法從這場戰爭裡安然脫身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩個星期前，整合運動與我們羅德島發生了暴力衝突，有許多幹員犧牲在了切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這種事已經在我們的身邊發生過太多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果每一次的犧牲都迫使我們轉身復仇，那我們就有無數的仇要去報，將有無數的人......會被殺死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被敵人殺死，被我們殺死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們與整合運動間的爭執，本不該建立在仇恨上。在能與對方談判的情況下，我們會要求對方為他們的行為作出解釋，承擔責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但到現在為止，整合運動依然沒有自他們的瘋狂行為中清醒過來。現在，他們正操作著切爾諾伯格核心城，衝向龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更詭異的是，烏薩斯並沒有放棄對核心城的領土控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯依然把切爾諾伯格核心城看做自己的領土，哪怕它現在被整合運動操控著，哪怕烏薩斯從來沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕烏薩斯從來沒有對整個事件做出任何反應。切爾諾伯格這座城市裡發生了種種可怕的事，烏薩斯帝國對此視而不見，也沒有採取手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那可是它們的國民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我認為，這次衝突背後隱藏著烏薩斯的陰謀。核心城的衝撞一定會帶來國家與國家的戰爭。一旦烏薩斯和炎開戰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候，做什麼都太晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論整合運動的背後有多少隱情、多少隱形的推力，無論罪魁禍首是誰，只有一個事實會被冷酷地擺在我們面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——“感染者挑發了這場戰爭。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論誰贏得了戰爭的勝利，感染者都是仇恨矛頭指向的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者面臨著的，是比現在更嚴苛的壓迫，更加艱苦的生存環境，還有......永遠無法被消解的仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，我們羅德島根植的土壤就會消失。這片大地上的各個國家，將不允許我們治療感染者，不允許他們獲得正常的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的......這也是我們和礦石病的漫長戰爭中，無法逃避的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，羅德島一直身在這場戰爭。這場戰爭，我們很難取勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算這樣，我們也不可能認輸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會用理智去對抗狂熱，用巧妙的戰術去戰勝敵意，我們不可能放棄，因為我們沒人希望最後只有一個不幸的結局等著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們要阻止整合運動，我們要去阻止切爾諾伯格核心城與龍門城的衝撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希望留艦的各位照顧好羅德島。不管我們能不能回來，羅德島都會堅持到最後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。一切照常運行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咻......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"說得好！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯，謝謝博士誇獎！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔？博士，我臉上，有什麼東西嗎？不會是......麵包屑吧？"}]},{"label":"你演講的樣子很迷人。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？！欸？！"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"會不會悲觀了些？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，也有幹員以前和我們這麼說過。他們說，在這個時候，要鼓勵大家，激發他們的志氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我慢慢發現，我們並不是那種團體。我們沒有那麼、那麼需要昂揚的鬥志，我們需要的是，對自己行為的理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"越是困難的時候，越應該把最真實的情況告訴大家，否則，我們的選擇就會是盲目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼會比遮著眼睛在大地上行走更危險呢......？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我聽說陳長官離開了龍門。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。這次，陳長官應該會一個人潛入切爾諾伯格核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門城，感染者，血緣關係......陳長官的身上糾結著許許多多的矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是這樣沉重的負擔，她也沒有放棄，沒有逃走，她帶著它們走向了切爾諾伯格核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"背叛，離鄉，死亡......她都不害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，陳長官是感染者。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什麼？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"啊......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我就知道是這樣。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們羅德島去核心城的同時，也會盡力援助她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅是因為她......不僅是因為陳長官已經算是我們的朋友，也並不完全因為這是龍門某位人物的私人委託。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官不會獨自面對整合運動。我們會和她一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她努力去維護的東西，她苦熬至今的沉默......我們去幫助她，是為了我們願望裡相似的部分。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"太好心了點吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我以為你會有點害怕那個鐵娘子。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，哈哈，博士的表情......真有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前懷疑過陳長官她，也想著她是我們無法改變的那種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，當她向感染者伸出援手的時候，我看到了，我看到了她心靈的顏色。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我頭一次聽到這種說法。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"這樣的形容挺有趣的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，唔，就，就是一種形容啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道怎麼和別人描述我看到的東西......直接傳輸給別人也很不禮貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但在移動城市中保護感染者，堅持這種信念是一件......壯舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官絕不是一個冷血無情的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也許她鐵面無私，但正因為如此，她的正義感會促使她起身與灰暗的大地戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使她從來都不這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們要去。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒問題，我也和人約好了要去！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"好。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"也有人希望我去阻止整合運動。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......Dr.{@nickname}，難道是在說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......霜星小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們還能做些什麼，能阻止米莎悲劇的重演，能寬慰霜星小姐和她的戰士們，還有什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼是能幫助到更多人，阻止這片大地生產更多悲哀的事，我們去做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"資料已經發給兩位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，將是我們三個人第一次共同指揮。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你會和我配合嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我該不該表現得更興奮一些？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以選擇不去。這是你的個人選擇，我無權改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望凱爾希醫生能拋棄對Dr.{@nickname}的成見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望Dr.{@nickname}別因為凱爾希醫生之前的言語......對她產生成見。暫時放下也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}失去了記憶。在短短兩個星期內，羅德島沒有可靠的方法讓博士重拾記憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以博士現在所擁有的，都是新的理解，新的認知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，我希望你用現在的眼光去看待現在的Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我也想你別因為凱爾希醫生現在說的那些話就懷疑她的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她是你最值得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......依靠的人。不管你是不是相信她，她都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"請兩位都答應我。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我還能怎麼樣？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我似乎沒得選。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有盡釋前嫌這個選項，道德不能使我們這樣的人變成更好的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有拒絕你提議的意思，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，純粹善意的寬恕，以及放棄自己憤怒的權力，只是讓我們變得無限軟弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我會一直保留這種權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在，我會擱置我的偏見，我們先去解決核心城這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"徹底地解決它。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，我站在你這邊。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，沒有！我不是覺得不好啦！其實是我......我有點，唔，我還有點反應不過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信博士會在最關鍵的時刻協助我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，以前的我想著的，是讓博士來指導我，在這些最困難的時候，做到那些我辦不到的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會變得更勇敢，只要博士在我身邊。以前我就是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，唔......醫生，我沒事。我知道的，我現在已經不會那麼依靠別人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是博士，只是對博士......我原本真的是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，博士，我們是肩並著肩了。從和你重逢開始，我就一直想找個機會，告訴博士，告訴博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我長大了。我已經不用博士，凱爾希醫生和......唔......遮風擋雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我會用成績回應博士的信任。一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！肩並肩是形容啊，不可以說我矮！我還在長高！......唔！！我很快就會長得和博士長得一樣高了，肯定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是很高興，博士。嗯。只是......很高興。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺這裡冷場了。需要我把指揮室的溫度調高一些嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士想保留自己的觀點，並沒有任何問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不希望強迫博士把想法說出來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，我們......我們每個人都有自己的空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，博士，哪怕只是給我一點點幫助......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。沒必要示弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}有擅長的事，也有不擅長的事。能力需要自行復甦的時間，Dr.{@nickname}也會在正確的時候做出正確的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人不會忘記從甦醒直至現在發生在自己面前的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——如果我真的可以這麼期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，這麼說也太傷人了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士不愛說話，只是博士不願說多餘的話。博士會直接抓住問題的核心，是吧？"}]},{"label":"凱爾希，合作愉快。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你願意的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想過你會這麼爽快地答應，甚至有理由懷疑你在語句裡設下了什麼陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......但又何妨呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}。合作愉快。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們有什麼計畫？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，博士是想問哪方面的計畫呢？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"首先要有進核心城的辦法。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"怎麼去？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"要直接走到塔露拉面前說“你好”，對不對。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島確實有屬於羅德島的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"請對照報告書。我會解釋計畫的每個部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"4小時後，我們將在切爾諾伯格核心城的必經之路附近引發一場小規模的沙暴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:00 a.m. 荒野"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"1號！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"1號抽壓機通電完成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"2號！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"2號彈倉已經準備完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"3號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"3號風倉，迷彩已經......已經遮蓋完畢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"迷彩會有用嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"切爾諾伯格核心城的指揮塔視野很廣，沒偽裝手段是不行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......把核心城當成軍艦設計，甚至都不屑掩飾自己的想法，帝國在赤裸裸地宣揚暴力和征服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，原來烏薩斯帝國的設計還有這種傾向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"設計催生想法，想法又反過來影響設計。他們烏薩斯人生活在這種環境，肯定會對外界充滿敵意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼說對普通的烏薩斯居民是不公平的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃......我，我去拿下備用線......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，烏薩斯在我的故鄉犯下了多少罪？多到他們連自己的手都洗不乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"現在他們又想借感染者的手挑起新的戰爭，更殘忍地加害感染者，難道這還不能說明烏薩斯的暴虐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"他們把田地燒光，拿碳灰把蓄水池填滿，整個村子都在燃燒，被烤焦的屍體到處都是......土地被毀了，剩下的只有廢墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我知道的烏薩斯人。如果不是烏薩斯居民支持了戰爭，這些事就不會發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一己之見——那並非是烏薩斯人的集體意願，相反，只是種邪惡想法的展現。我們不傷害烏薩斯人。我們只是對抗邪惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"守林人，即使這一次我們並沒站在卡西米爾的土地上，但你所說的，我們不會讓它在我們面前重演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"這與敵人是不是烏薩斯並無關係。整合運動也許把自己看作是烏薩斯人，也許不，但我們不是去傷害他人。我們是要阻止他們去傷害他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......騎士從沒幫過我們遊擊隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我的隊長和副隊長等了那麼多年，但等到最後，援軍也沒有來。只有我們自己戰鬥到最後一刻，戰鬥到被烏薩斯吞噬，只有幾個人活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我能相信誰？相信烏薩斯人其實心地善良嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有怪罪你們騎士，尤其是......怪罪你的意思，臨光。我只是想起了和烏薩斯戰鬥的時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信烏薩斯，也不相信卡西米爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"這是卡西米爾騎士的錯誤。騎士們沒可能彌補錯誤，也不能真正守護好卡西米爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但今天的我們可以並肩作戰，守林人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"過去的我沒有幫助你的機會，這一次，我們戰鬥。我們戰鬥，不為了我們的祖國，只為阻止烏薩斯的暴行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我們這次只做支援工作，但我也做好了準備。為信仰而戰，為你而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"為別人而死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士不都像你這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但我相信騎士就應該如此。為他人而死是有意義的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"守林人小姐，請允許我用這一次戰鬥向你表達歉意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......幹員臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼需要我去做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們在儀器開始全速運轉前，守住這片區域。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"narration","text":"4小時前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這就是我們的偽裝？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以我們已經選好了一種隱蔽方式。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"歷經了多次重大武裝衝突事件，隱秘登城幾乎是幹員的必修課了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然每次的情況都不同，但利用地形地勢偽裝自己，卻一直是必須的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候是在皚皚雪地，有時候在草原，還有時候在沼澤......我們用的方法都不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"現在龍門城所在的位置被沙漠和荒地包圍，透過沙塵去掩蓋蹤跡，是最方便高效的辦法。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不覺得這能行。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"還不夠。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"完全依靠這個戰術是不明智的吧？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是一種隱蔽我們蹤跡的方式。羅德島不會實施任何單線單向的行動。一次成功的潛入，需要種種已經完備的條件去支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿撒茲勒診所帶給我們的資料，驗證了我手上切爾諾伯格工程圖紙的真實性，我們對核心城下層結構已經有了相當的把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"屆時，我們將從核心城的排水與基礎工業部分進入核心城。但與此同時，我們還需要誘餌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有誘餌，獵物不會上鉤。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"對獵人也一樣。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......對。是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"隨著時間推移，最拙劣的獵人也能分辨出獵物與誘餌的不同。我們要在他們識破我們之前避開他們的視線。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:00 a.m."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這次作戰不需要我們實地降落，對嗎教官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城地勢不好，看上去整合運動的裝備也不差，術師的數量更是不少，降下去估計有點費力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要，只需要擺出一副要登陸的樣子，在核心城上空盤旋段時間就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"再說我們沒帶戰術小隊，只有我們兩個下去沒什麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，我怎麼沒想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......這種安排怎麼會沒想到......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"開，開個玩笑，玩笑。教官不要對我這麼凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......你和“壞傢伙”上那個小心謹慎的小夥子比，實在是粗枝大葉了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"半小時左右，沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"要足夠引人注目！雖然廢城的整合運動知道我們用過飛行器，但核心城的這些敵人，我們可不知道他們有沒有得到消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，這架“好男孩”號，可比“壞傢伙”顯眼多了！半小時之內，絕對讓他們挪不開視線，教官你就看我的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"還是小心為好，可別被打下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"大可放心啊教官，我帶著阿斯卡綸和煌，那麼多次低空飛行也從來沒被人打下來過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......一旦被打下來就沒有下一次了啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_perimeter"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:00 am  核心城外圍"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"天上那個......是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"居然在天上飛？！是敵人的新武器嗎！是哪個國家派來的？別管了，射擊，快射擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道那東西裡面裝了什麼，千萬別讓它落地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"別驚慌！只要它敢下降，我們就能把它炸開！別讓它躲到我們看不見的地方就行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘飛船有什麼安全設施？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕高嗎教官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"有一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦出事的話，大家都來不及反應的，要是墜毀了鐵定屍體都不剩，大家都一樣的啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我能不擔心嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我們已經成功吸引了敵人的注意力，讓他們認為我們準備從空中降落，你們立刻開始行動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"作戰幹員，注意！有稀散的敵人正在向我們的方向靠近，很可能是敵城市的先遣偵察部隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"裝置正在運轉中，不能讓他們干擾到我們的計畫。守林人小姐，掩護我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"知道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["整合運動術師"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["臨光"]},{"speakerId":"char_158_milu","aliases":["守林人"]}]}
